WEBVTT

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:13.180
Romeo's Blue Skies

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:13.180
TAKARA FANSUBS

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:12.830
"To the Sky..."

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:17.580
Overlooking the rows of houses and stores

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:21.280
from the highest vantage,

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:26.780
Such things as tears and sadness

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:30.680
will quickly vanish

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:36.880
The birds, wind, and sunshine...

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:40.880
...all are your friends

00:00:41.290 --> 00:00:45.790
I'll carry this dream farther than far

00:00:45.990 --> 00:00:50.390
...no matter the distance...

00:00:52.590 --> 00:00:57.590
I long to fly freely

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:01.790
through the blue sky in my heart...

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:04.690
The far distant blue sky

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:12.190
It flows into tomorrow

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:34.980
During the storm, the boat carrying the children to Milan sank into the lake.

00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:43.480
But by some miracle, Romeo, Alfredo and the God of Death reached the shore alive.

00:01:44.180 --> 00:01:49.880
From there, the melancholy trio resumed their journey to Milan.

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:57.080
Episode 7:

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:57.080
An Angel's Abode

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:08.880
How about it? This crop is really tasty.

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:16.780
Looks like things are finally getting lively.

00:02:16.980 --> 00:02:19.460
Yes... we're finally close to Milan.

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:35.380
Look at it, Romeo!

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:07.580
This is really something!

00:03:07.880 --> 00:03:09.680
It feels like we're in dreamland!

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:22.330
So that's the famous great cathedral?

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:26.980
They look like icicles!

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:38.580
Jeez, this boss is such a slave-driver!

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:56.080
Hey, everyone! The God of Death has come back!

00:03:56.480 --> 00:03:59.480
He's come back from hell!

00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:03.580
God, you startled me!

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:06.480
We were just praying for your departed soul.

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:10.880
Look... the newspaper says that everyone drowned!

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:20.080
Romeo and Alfredo were troubled.

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:23.080
They realized that the only person they knew in the entire city,

00:04:23.180 --> 00:04:27.080
...was, ironically, the God of Death...

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:33.930
...yet it seemed to those two as if he had forgotten them.

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:44.680
What're you looking at, soon-to-be-sold?

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:47.980
Listen up, oaf!

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:49.280
Oaf?

00:04:49.380 --> 00:04:53.880
The bosses who're gonna buy you are just now on their way over here.

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:55.080
Bosses?

00:04:55.180 --> 00:04:58.180
Your chimney-sweeping bosses, oaf!

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:03.280
But... only two for sale?

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:05.280
Not much to choose from.

00:05:11.380 --> 00:05:13.680
There, see. Here come the bosses.

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:18.280
Hey Luini, I heard you really put your foot in it this time!

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:20.080
Well, well, very shrewd of you!

00:05:20.180 --> 00:05:23.580
And I was thinking I wouldn't be able to get my hands on any kids this year.

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:26.680
So, where are they?

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:29.380
And the rest?

00:05:29.380 --> 00:05:30.480
That's all there is.

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:31.980
THAT'S IT?

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:34.780
So there's only two?

00:05:34.880 --> 00:05:39.280
What the Hell! Neither of 'em even looks like they'd be productive!

00:05:49.980 --> 00:05:50.980
What're you doing?

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:52.280
Stop it!

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:54.080
Why you...

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:03.980
I've fallen for ya.

00:06:05.980 --> 00:06:10.080
Aw, why not. I'll buy this one. How much?

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:11.380
Eighty lira.

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:14.680
Eighty lira?!

00:06:14.880 --> 00:06:17.080
What's he thinking?

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:18.680
I've never heard of such a price!

00:06:18.780 --> 00:06:20.080
Not for one kid!

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:22.580
Cut the jokes!

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:27.480
Luini, you bastard!

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:30.580
I heard you're sellin' off kids?

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:32.180
We were waitin' for ya, Luini!

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:33.680
How much per kid?

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:35.480
Eighty-two lira.

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:38.880
Why you... you just said eighty lira!

00:06:38.980 --> 00:06:41.580
When the demand goes up, the price goes up.

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:44.380
If you're planning on buying, now is the time.

00:06:44.780 --> 00:06:47.380
God of Death, you amaze me.

00:06:47.980 --> 00:06:50.380
Gotta choose, before there's more buyers here...

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:54.580
All right, I'm buying this one.

00:06:55.380 --> 00:06:56.380
Romeo!

00:06:56.480 --> 00:06:57.780
That ain't fair, you guys!

00:06:57.780 --> 00:06:58.980
Yeah, what about us?

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:00.780
First come, first serve.

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:04.080
So... eighty and two lira, was it?

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:05.380
Eighty-five lira.

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:07.280
EIGHTY-FIVE lira!

00:07:07.380 --> 00:07:08.980
If you don't like it you don't have to pay.

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:11.880
Can't be helped.

00:07:22.780 --> 00:07:24.980
Okay, I'll buy this one.

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:29.380
Citron, put that away.

00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:31.980
This kid is MINE.

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:33.980
You're not gettin' your hands on him.

00:07:34.780 --> 00:07:35.880
All right!

00:07:35.980 --> 00:07:37.380
Stop that, Citron!

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:42.080
Pull something again and you're headed for jail, you know!

00:07:46.380 --> 00:07:49.080
Hey kid... come over here.

00:07:58.280 --> 00:08:01.780
There, 86 lira, and you better not have a problem with that!

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:03.980
Now, this one's mine.

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:10.180
That decides it.

00:08:10.280 --> 00:08:11.480
Don't gimme that!

00:08:11.530 --> 00:08:13.380
What are we supposed to do?

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:15.180
Only two kids, why that's...

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:17.980
Pipe down and quit whining!

00:08:18.380 --> 00:08:20.680
Winners and losers all, let's be nice to each other.

00:08:20.690 --> 00:08:23.680
Nikita, distribute the drinks.

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:25.280
I was waitin' for that!

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:35.180
And so, Romeo and Alfredo were sold.

00:08:35.680 --> 00:08:39.080
They were finally free from the grasp of the God of Death.

00:08:45.580 --> 00:08:49.180
That was the God of Death's final salutation.

00:08:56.880 --> 00:08:58.580
Hey Rossi...

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:01.580
I wonder what your wife's gonna say to you...

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:03.380
I'm looking forward to this!

00:09:04.780 --> 00:09:06.680
It looks like it's finally goodbye.

00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:13.980
Even though I just met you a week ago, it feels as if I've known you forever.

00:09:14.580 --> 00:09:17.030
You're the first close friend I've ever had.

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:20.580
You're the first real friend I ever met too.

00:09:27.180 --> 00:09:29.380
Romeo, let's make an oath.

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:30.280
An oath?

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:34.030
Even when our troubles are like a river, our eternal friendship is our safe shore.

00:09:37.980 --> 00:09:41.080
Even if we're separated, remember that oath.

00:09:41.980 --> 00:09:45.280
C'mon, let's go. And don't dawdle!

00:09:45.380 --> 00:09:47.780
Wait, give me just a moment more!

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:49.380
Alfredo!

00:09:49.680 --> 00:09:51.380
Oop, where're YOU going?

00:09:54.180 --> 00:09:54.980
Wait!

00:09:55.680 --> 00:09:58.680
I'd like to at least tell my friend where I'm going.

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:00.580
Where you're GOING?

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:03.480
Just one block away... to hell!

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:05.680
Let go, let me go!

00:10:05.780 --> 00:10:07.380
He's already gone.

00:10:07.780 --> 00:10:09.580
We hadn't finished our oath yet!

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:10.680
Oath?

00:10:14.580 --> 00:10:17.280
Neither of you'll ever see the other again!

00:10:26.380 --> 00:10:27.380
I'll be back...

00:10:27.680 --> 00:10:30.280
Oh crap, the kid ran off!

00:10:31.380 --> 00:10:32.780
Hurry up and run after him!

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:35.980
Stop, you!

00:10:36.680 --> 00:10:38.080
I want to finish my oath!

00:10:38.380 --> 00:10:40.280
I'll be back, I promise.

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:42.280
Very sorry!

00:10:51.980 --> 00:10:54.180
Alfredo, where are you?

00:11:00.880 --> 00:11:02.480
Alfredo!

00:11:04.780 --> 00:11:05.780
Romeo!

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:06.980
Hurry up-- get on.

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:11.280
Alfredo!

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:12.680
Romeo!

00:11:12.780 --> 00:11:13.780
Alfredo...

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:14.880
I... I...

00:11:17.380 --> 00:11:18.080
Romeo!

00:11:18.680 --> 00:11:19.880
Alfredo!

00:11:20.180 --> 00:11:21.280
I won't...

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:24.080
I won't say goodbye!

00:11:25.380 --> 00:11:27.080
We'll meet again, I know it!

00:11:29.380 --> 00:11:30.380
I swear!

00:11:33.280 --> 00:11:37.880
We'll always be together, no matter how far they separate us!

00:11:38.780 --> 00:11:40.380
No matter HOW far!

00:11:47.080 --> 00:11:49.680
I won't forget.
Today is the day...

00:11:50.080 --> 00:11:51.380
...that we made this oath.

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:19.580
Piccolo!

00:12:20.780 --> 00:12:22.680
Stop!

00:12:31.880 --> 00:12:33.880
Jeez, I promised I'd come back.

00:12:43.480 --> 00:12:45.180
Trouble from the start!

00:12:45.380 --> 00:12:48.480
I sure as hell blew my money this time.

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:52.280
Don't try and run away again, do you hear me?

00:12:52.380 --> 00:12:53.780
I'm sorry...

00:13:21.680 --> 00:13:23.030
What're you staring at?

00:13:23.480 --> 00:13:24.680
Sorry.

00:13:34.780 --> 00:13:36.080
Let's go.

00:13:55.580 --> 00:13:57.580
Where are we going?

00:13:57.880 --> 00:14:01.180
Where? Where d'you think?! My house!

00:14:02.180 --> 00:14:04.480
Eighty-five lira...

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:06.880
The old lady's gonna be pissed.

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:09.080
Who's going to be pissed?

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:11.580
Will you shut your mouth ONE SECOND?!

00:14:14.280 --> 00:14:15.880
Did it again...

00:14:20.280 --> 00:14:25.080
Anyway, don't let your mouth run off from now on, you got it?

00:14:27.480 --> 00:14:28.730
Yes.

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:37.080
Mr. Rossi.

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:39.180
Hello, Madela.

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:40.880
A new boy?

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:43.580
Yes, and a bleeding ruffian...

00:14:43.680 --> 00:14:45.680
He's already caused an incident!

00:14:46.380 --> 00:14:48.080
Energetic is good, isn't it?

00:14:54.380 --> 00:14:56.580
Oh yes, how is she doing?

00:14:56.680 --> 00:14:58.380
That angel that lives with you?

00:15:00.180 --> 00:15:03.780
It's lonely not being able to see that cute face from the window.

00:15:03.830 --> 00:15:04.980
Angel...?

00:15:05.180 --> 00:15:09.180
Flew away on a pair of teeny wings, all the way to Paris.

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:12.480
She'll be back by tonight, though.

00:15:15.480 --> 00:15:16.830
Angel?

00:15:18.330 --> 00:15:19.480
Hurry up and get up here!

00:15:19.480 --> 00:15:20.580
Yes sir!

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:26.080
Come on in.

00:15:40.980 --> 00:15:42.780
What took you so long?

00:15:43.680 --> 00:15:45.080
Ah, hello...

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:47.580
Well, did you bring home a kid?

00:15:47.680 --> 00:15:48.880
Ye... yes...

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:52.580
Come here.

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:53.580
Yes ma'am!

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:57.280
Your name?

00:15:57.280 --> 00:15:58.130
Romeo.

00:16:01.680 --> 00:16:04.480
I don't like this uppity-looking sort.

00:16:05.280 --> 00:16:08.180
Banish the thought! He's a very well-behaved boy.

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:10.080
So, how much was he?

00:16:11.880 --> 00:16:15.580
Well? I'll know it if I count the money in your wallet.

00:16:16.480 --> 00:16:18.580
What's it matter, anyway?

00:16:19.880 --> 00:16:21.680
"What's it MATTER"?

00:16:23.280 --> 00:16:24.480
What're you doing?

00:16:25.180 --> 00:16:26.680
Give me your wallet!

00:16:27.180 --> 00:16:28.580
That hurts!

00:16:28.680 --> 00:16:30.880
Okay, I'll tell you.

00:16:33.880 --> 00:16:35.880
Well, it was... about eighty-five...

00:16:35.880 --> 00:16:36.830
Eh?

00:16:36.880 --> 00:16:38.130
Eighty-five lira!

00:16:38.630 --> 00:16:40.230
Eighty-five...

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:44.630
Edda!

00:16:44.930 --> 00:16:47.830
It was fifty-five lira the last time!

00:16:47.830 --> 00:16:49.730
And we couldn't even make back our investment!

00:16:49.830 --> 00:16:51.830
There were only two kids!

00:16:51.930 --> 00:16:55.230
If I hadn't paid it he would've been bought by someone else!

00:16:55.330 --> 00:16:58.830
That doesn't mean you have to go and spent eighty-five lira!

00:16:58.930 --> 00:17:03.430
We're not gonna get squat if we put Anzelmo to work!

00:17:08.830 --> 00:17:10.930
Why you... beast!

00:17:10.940 --> 00:17:14.130
Are you saying to put our precious only son to work cleaning chimneys?

00:17:14.230 --> 00:17:15.730
I didn't mean it!

00:17:15.830 --> 00:17:17.130
Stop it, will you?

00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:18.230
Dad!

00:17:18.330 --> 00:17:19.330
Anzelmo!

00:17:20.530 --> 00:17:23.530
Are you going to put me into a chimney?

00:17:24.730 --> 00:17:27.030
I was just saying that as an example.

00:17:27.130 --> 00:17:28.730
Is that true, Dad?

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:29.630
Of course!

00:17:29.930 --> 00:17:31.030
Mom!

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:38.130
Saying such things about my Anzelmo will surely shorten my life!

00:18:07.130 --> 00:18:08.430
What're you looking at?

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:10.930
Ummm... Where is mine...?

00:18:11.030 --> 00:18:12.330
I'm apalled!

00:18:12.380 --> 00:18:15.930
He hasn't even worked yet and expects to get food.

00:18:22.530 --> 00:18:24.930
Hurry up and take him away!

00:18:25.930 --> 00:18:26.930
All right.

00:18:31.330 --> 00:18:34.630
Just be thankful you've even got a place to sleep.

00:18:38.430 --> 00:18:40.130
Quit doting! Move!

00:18:43.430 --> 00:18:46.230
Don't you dare even get near that room, do you hear me?

00:18:46.530 --> 00:18:47.430
Why?

00:18:47.830 --> 00:18:49.980
Because it's none of your business!

00:18:55.230 --> 00:18:56.830
This is your room.

00:19:27.530 --> 00:19:28.830
Go on in.

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:32.830
Get the lead out!

00:19:35.130 --> 00:19:38.630
Until I know you won't try to escape again, I'm locking the door.

00:19:43.730 --> 00:19:47.180
We can't go and give you the Pope's bedchamber, you know...

00:20:09.030 --> 00:20:11.430
So this is our room, he says.

00:20:12.930 --> 00:20:15.080
Piccolo, that tickles!

00:20:15.830 --> 00:20:16.930
Cut it out!

00:20:28.130 --> 00:20:30.080
Can't help it, Piccolo.

00:20:30.630 --> 00:20:33.230
After all, he can't go and give us the Pope's bedchamber...

00:20:38.230 --> 00:20:40.630
Dad... Mom...

00:20:41.430 --> 00:20:43.930
I'm finally in Milan.

00:20:46.430 --> 00:20:49.230
I wonder how Alfredo's doing...

00:21:33.930 --> 00:21:35.030
The angel!

00:21:44.330 --> 00:21:46.730
There really is an angel in that room!

00:21:55.130 --> 00:21:57.130
Today is my first day of work.

00:21:57.530 --> 00:22:01.430
My boss took me into town and suddenly started yelling something out loud.

00:22:01.530 --> 00:22:03.830
What, you want me to do it too?

00:22:04.930 --> 00:22:06.630
Spatza camino!

00:22:07.630 --> 00:22:10.430
Next time:
A Gift from an Angel
See you then!

00:22:12.180 --> 00:22:16.180
"Si Si Ciao ~ On These Roman Roofs"

00:22:24.880 --> 00:22:28.980
Si Si Ciao, why do the good times

00:22:29.080 --> 00:22:33.280
seem to end so soon?

00:22:33.480 --> 00:22:37.480
Si Si Ciao, we're all friends

00:22:37.680 --> 00:22:41.680
Let's meet again on these Roman roofs

00:22:42.290 --> 00:22:46.590
Your laughing voice dances

00:22:46.590 --> 00:22:50.490
Once again in the sky

00:22:50.890 --> 00:22:57.790
Your pocket bursting with memories

00:22:59.490 --> 00:23:03.390
Si Si Ciao, goodbye but for now

00:23:03.590 --> 00:23:07.590
Let's meet again on these Roman roofs
